## Key Technical Decisions
================================================================================

- Architecture: FastAPI backend + Gradio frontend (separate processes)
- Streaming: Server-Sent Events (SSE)
- Session: UUID-based, in-memory + JSON persistence
- Embedding: Ollama bge-large-zh (1024 dims)
- Vector DB: ChromaDB (persistent)
- Hybrid Retrieval: Vector + BM25 with RRF fusion
- Reranker: Cross-Encoder (bge-reranker-large)
- Model Config: YAML > ENV priority, hot reload support
- Document Parsing: Factory pattern for extensibility
- Health Check: Startup validation with production blocking

